Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 00:06:16 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 04/52] nxfs: open XCI game card images

Splatoon 3's base game here is a game card dump (XCI). nxfs only read NSP
(PFS0) files. hfs0.rs parses HFS0 partitions (unencrypted), xci.rs finds
the root HFS0 from the card header (also with a 0x1000 key-area prefix) and
its secure partition, whose NCAs use the normal key-area encryption.
package_files() lists either container and Nsp::open accepts both, so
nxhost --base can point at an XCI and the BKTR RomFS is read in place
without an extracted copy.

